name: sim.getReferencedHandles
description: Retrieves a list of custom handles, linking a given scene object to other scene objects
luaSynopsis: list referencedHandles = sim.getReferencedHandles(int objectHandle, string tag = '')
pythonSynopsis: int[] referencedHandles = sim.getReferencedHandles(int objectHandle, string tag = '')
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the scene object that stores the list of handles. Can be optionally combined with sim.handleflag_keeporiginal, in which case the handles that link to originals are retrieved.
2. tag: a tag: only handles stored within that tag are retrieved. defaults to an empty tag
outputs:
1. referencedHandles: an array with scene object handles
